Today I presented the quarterly roadmap to the leadership team. It went well, and they approved the first phase. I felt nervous before the meeting but proud afterwards.

状态：COMPLETED
线索（模型输出，中文）：
- EVENT：Presented the quarterly roadmap to the leadership team.（事实，0.95）
